Consolidate the Interactivity API stores behind WooCommerce's product and cart blocks into a single `@woocommerce/stores/woocommerce` store. The `woocommerce/products` Interactivity API namespace and the `@woocommerce/stores/woocommerce/cart` and `@woocommerce/stores/woocommerce/products` script module ids are removed with no aliases, so code that imports either id or reads that namespace stops working.
